OL,3,GNEWSAFunding for island children's hub
OL,4,Aapproved
OL,5,
OL,6,FFunding to bring all children's health,
OL,7,Fsocial care, and family support
OL,8,Fservices into one site has been
OL,9,Fapproved by an island government.
OL,11,FThe States of Guernsey said it would
OL,12,Fmerge the services currently offered at
OL,13,Fseven sites on the island to a single
OL,14,Flocation at Raymond Falla House, in St
OL,15,FMartin.
OL,17,FIt said the move - costing between #16m
OL,18,Fand #22m - meant families would not
OL,19,Fhave to repeat their stories when
OL,20,Fvisiting different centres, and staff
OL,21,Fwould save travel time.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
